---
title: "decryptSealedBid (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_key: check decryption private key is published
    q_check_key --> q_revert_key: private key not yet published
    q_revert_key --> [*]: revert DecryptionKeyNotAvailable
    q_check_key --> q_get_bid: private key available
    q_get_bid --> q_decrypt: retrieve stored encryptedBid for investor
    q_decrypt --> q_validate: ECIES decrypt(privateKey, encryptedBid)
    q_validate --> q_return: decryption successful
    q_return --> [*]: return decrypted bid amount

    note right of q_decrypt
        INV-001: decryption only possible after private key publication
        INV-002: anyone can call this function (public view after key release)
        INV-003: decrypted amount represents investor desired token allocation
    end note
